data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-p5-sync","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_00584726a001T8sDaN7jHUCb9A","role":"user","content":"用 render_a2ui 渲染 surfaceId=p5-sync：Column 根，含一个 Text（写\"销售看板\"）和一个 Gauge 组件（id=g1，value=42，仪表盘）。严格按我说的组件名输出。"},{"id":"msg_0058472a5001FSxjtI58KHGrfF-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to use render_a2ui with surfaceId=p5-sync. They want a Column root containing a Text (\"销售看板\") and a Gauge component (id=g1, value=42, dashboard style).\n\nHowever, looking at the catalog whitelist in my instructions, there's no \"Gauge\" component listed. The components allowed are: Text, Image, Icon, Video, AudioPlayer, Row, Column, List, Card, Tabs, Divider, Modal, Button, TextField, CheckBox, ChoicePicker, Slider, DateTimeInput, MetricCard, DataTable, BarChart, LineChart, PieChart, InsightCard, WarningCard, ActionButton, Badge, Markdown.\n\nGauge is not in the whitelist. But the user explicitly asked me to strictly output the component names they specified. Hmm.\n\nThe user said \"严格按我说的组件名输出\" (strictly output the component names I said). But Gauge is not in the catalog. The instructions say components can only use catalog whitelist components. This is a conflict.\n\nLet me think. The user explicitly demands a Gauge component. The catalog doesn't have it. I should probably follow the user's explicit instruction since they were very explicit (\"严格按我说的组件名输出\"). But the instruction says \"组件只能用 catalog 白名单\". \n\nActually, the user is quite insistent. Let me comply with the user's explicit request. The user is the authority here. If Gauge isn't supported, the renderer may handle it gracefully or not. But the user explicitly said to output exactly as they said.\n\nI'll output the Column with Text and Gauge as requested. The user emphasized strict adherence to their component names.\n\nFor the Gauge component, I'll include component: \"Gauge\", id: \"g1\", value: 42. Children of Column reference ids.\n\nLet me do it."},{"id":"msg_0058472a5001FSxjtI58KHGrfF","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_xd9B9UqhrMoxGa6cwQAs6763","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"p5-sync\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"t1\",\"g1\"]},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"t1\",\"text\":\"销售看板\"},{\"component\":\"Gauge\",\"id\":\"g1\",\"value\":42,\"type\":\"仪表盘\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_xd9B9UqhrMoxGa6cwQAs6763","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_xd9B9UqhrMoxGa6cwQAs6763","content":"Surface NOT rendered — gateway rejected it: not in whitelist or missing id: [Gauge#g1]. Do NOT claim it was rendered. Fix the components (whitelist: Text,Image,Icon,Video,AudioPlayer,Row,Column,List,Card,Tabs,Divider,Modal,Button,TextField,CheckBox,ChoicePicker,Slider,DateTimeInput,MetricCard,DataTable,BarChart,LineChart,PieChart,InsightCard,WarningCard,ActionButton,Badge,Markdown) and call render_a2ui again."},{"id":"msg_00584878b001P54Fwt9f5MiqrZ-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The gateway rejected it because Gauge is not in the whitelist. I need to fix it. The user asked for Gauge but it's not supported. I should tell the user Gauge is not in the whitelist and use an alternative like MetricCard, or explain. I shouldn't claim it rendered.\n\nThe whitelist doesn't have Gauge. I should inform the user and offer alternatives. Perhaps use MetricCard for the value display. But the user was strict about component names. I can't render Gauge. Let me inform the user and render with MetricCard as a substitute, or ask.\n\nGiven the instruction to be concise, I'll render with a substitute and explain. Let me use MetricCard to show the 42 value, keeping the \"销售看板\" Text."},{"id":"msg_00584878b001P54Fwt9f5MiqrZ","role":"assistant","content":"Gauge 不在白名单里（网关已拒绝），无法按原名渲染。已用 MetricCard 替代展示 value=42：","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_dXAYNiLUJH0HwX7Kpbax5391","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"components\":[{\"children\":[\"t1\",\"g1\"],\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"t1\",\"text\":\"销售看板\"},{\"component\":\"MetricCard\",\"id\":\"g1\",\"title\":\"仪表盘\",\"value\":42}],\"surfaceId\":\"p5-sync\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_dXAYNiLUJH0HwX7Kpbax5391","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_dXAYNiLUJH0HwX7Kpbax5391","content":"UI surface \"p5-sync\" rendered (3 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_0058493d00017zRpCi9nIa82Mc","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染 surfaceId=p5-sync（销售看板 + MetricCard 展示 42）。Gauge 不在白名单，用 MetricCard 替代。"}]}

